<title>JAPAN: Olympic Sports OTC registration cancelled.</title>
<headline>Olympic Sports OTC registration cancelled.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Japan Securities Dealers Association (JSDA) said on Friday that it had cancelled Olympic Sports Co's registration on the over-the-counter (OTC) market.</p>
<p>The JSDA's move followed Olympic Sports' application for court mediation with creditors early in the day. The sports equipment retailer said in a statement that it had debts totalling 34.83 billion yen.</p>
